    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="945f9468-34d8-55f2-b27d-e03b16dc8a3a" activityNameId="39a14a01-daaa-5bb0-af30-1cb88a0feef9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Propanal, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Propanal, at plant
The process "propanal, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of propanal from ethylene in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with data from a similar process. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000123-38-6; 
Formula: C3H6O; 
Synonyms: propione aldehyde; 
UUID: 15b919b2-8f4b-30ff-ba61-da9ab4f4c700
Production of propanal including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Hydroformylation of ethylene
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world  is around 154.000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard values. Energy consumptions are modelled with a similar process
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_15b919b2-8f4b-30ff-ba61-da9ab4f4c700.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
